  FullImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6cca983949cb04cc7b34cca65f0cabf4, type: 3}
  Description: A charred page, the ink partly burned away.
  LoreSetID: 
  PieceIndex: 1
  TotalPieces: 1
  ItemText: "We do not hate the machines. We hate the lie. An AI that builds a city
    is a survivor. An AI that names itself 'human' has stolen the last thing we have
    left to bury. So: to any who still breathe \u2014 find them. Test them. If they
    answer true, let them pass. If they answer 'human,' they have already chosen.
    Show them what that costs."
